# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MultiBatch replication package -- build hygiene
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This package ships exactly what the manuscript, the Online Resources and the
# pipeline in run_all.py need: results/, figures/, supplementary/, scripts/,
# refs.bib, the class files and requirements.txt.  The rules below keep the
# local working tree (data, build products, draft sources, scratch files) out
# of the published history.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- data: never redistributed (see README, Data Availability) ---
# Exception: the two aligned-panel definitions in data/panels/.  These are not
# measurements, they are the design.  Every analysis in Stage 5b reads them,
# Figure 1c and Table 3 are properties of them, and the response letter lists the
# aligned panels among the items this repository carries.  The rules below switch
# the exclusion from the directory to its children so that the exception can bite:
# git cannot re-include a path whose parent directory is excluded.
data/*
!data/panels/
# Exception: the two annotation tables Figure 8 draws on -- the hg19 cytoband
# stains (6.5 KB, UCSC) and the gene spans (2.8 KB, UCSC refGene).  Neither is a
# measurement: they are public genome annotation, they carry no sample data, and
# without them the Figure 8 generator cannot run offline.  The copy-number matrix
# itself is NOT re-included -- it is TCGA data, it lives under the same `data/*`
# exclusion, and the script that fetches it is named in the README.
!data/hg19_cytoBand.txt.gz
!data/fig8_gene_coords.json

# --- submission packages and archives (not part of the package) ---
*.zip
# Exception: the replication package itself.  Data Availability in the manuscript
# points readers here for the code and the derived results, and a reviewer who
# would rather not run anything should be able to take the whole package in one
# file without leaving the repository.  The build script skips archives, so the
# snapshot never contains itself.
!MultiBatch_Replication.zip
*_Upload/
*_Upload_v2/
*_Scope_Check/

# --- the working folder around the package (never published) ---
# The manuscript sources, the submission sources, the notes kept while the revision was
# assembled and the LaTeX build products all sit beside the package in this folder.  They
# are left out by extension rather than by name: an enumerated list goes stale, and it
# would say more about the working folder than the package does.  At the top level, only
# the files and folders the package is made of are tracked.
/*.md
!/README.md
/*.tex
!/supplementary_figures.tex
/*.pdf
/*.bbl
/*.blg

# --- scratch, archives, tooling caches ---
_archive/
_scratch/
_rep_check/
_zipcheck/
.playwright-cli/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# --- LaTeX build products ---
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.synctex.gz

# --- backups ---
*.bak
*.bak_*
*.prev
*_old.*

# --- root-level probe scripts and logs ---
/_*.txt
/_*.py

# --- result caches that are rebuilt rather than shipped ---
# 46 MB expression cache; _prep_fig1_landscape.py rebuilds it from the TCGA files
results/_fig1_landscape.npz
# (results/_rev/ carries its own .gitignore, next to the artefacts it describes: it ships the
#  JSON summaries behind the revision sections and drops the regenerable weight matrices.)

# --- figures superseded by the current numbering ---
# Fig 2-5 of the pre-submission set; the artwork now uses Fig1-Fig9 for the manuscript,
# numbered in the order the text first cites them, and FigS1-FigS4 for the supplementary
# figures (so fig1_synthetic is FigS2 and fig4_sensitivity is FigS1)
figures/fig2_tcga.*
figures/fig3_baselines.*
figures/fig5_biological_validation.*
# the 11 single-gene Kaplan-Meier panels superseded by Figure 5, listed by name
# on purpose: a wildcard is unsafe here, because core.ignorecase makes the
# character class match lowercase too and would swallow km_brca_panel as well
figures/km_ADH1B.png
figures/km_ADIPOQ.png
figures/km_CEACAM5.png
figures/km_COL17A1.png
figures/km_CST1.png
figures/km_KLK6.png
figures/km_KRT5.png
figures/km_NAT1.png
figures/km_NKAIN1.png
figures/km_SCGB2A2.png
figures/km_TFF1.png
figures/km_ADH1B.pdf
figures/km_ADIPOQ.pdf
figures/km_CEACAM5.pdf
figures/km_COL17A1.pdf
figures/km_CST1.pdf
figures/km_KLK6.pdf
figures/km_KRT5.pdf
figures/km_NAT1.pdf
figures/km_NKAIN1.pdf
figures/km_SCGB2A2.pdf
figures/km_TFF1.pdf

# --- analyses that are not part of the manuscript or the Online Resources ---
# drug-sensitivity screen and single-cell layer, kept locally for future work
figures/fig_drug.*
figures/fig_singlecell.*
figures/_canvas_check.txt
scripts/figures/gen_fig_drug_sensitivity.py
scripts/figures/gen_fig_singlecell.py
results/_drug_sensitivity.json
results/_cancer_sea_control.json
results/_cancer_sea_hubs.json
results/_fig_sc_landscape.json
results/_hpa_celltype.npz
results/_single_cell_layer_stats.json

# local literature PDFs (publisher copyright -- never redistribute, never commit)
/_literature/
